.TH KINTSUGI-LAB 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-lab \- compose lab management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi lab
up
.br
.B kintsugi lab
down
.br
.B kintsugi lab
status
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bring up, tear down, or inspect the compose lab. Labs are synthetic,
egress-free environments for testing.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBup\fR
Bring up the lab
.IP \fBdown\fR
Tear down the lab
.IP \fBstatus\fR
Inspect the lab
.SH EXAMPLES
Start the lab:
.PP
  $ kintsugi lab up
.PP
Check status:
.PP
  $ kintsugi lab status
.PP
Stop the lab:
.PP
  $ kintsugi lab down
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1)
